tags.description:
Deal statuses represent whether your deals are still being worked on,
or have been finished. Your deals can be in one of three possible
statuses:

1. `ongoing` (`Em andamento`): deal is still being worked on;
2. `won` (`Ganho`): deal is finished and was won;
3. `lost` (`Perdido`): deal is finished and was lost.

